-- Intentionally contains no account INSERT statements.
--
-- Password hashes must be generated by the same ASP.NET Core PasswordHasher<Account>
-- configuration used by the application. A fabricated SQL hash or plaintext password
-- would be insecure and may not authenticate. Development accounts remain the
-- responsibility of Data/DbSeeder.cs. Production needs an approved, secure bootstrap
-- administrator provisioning process; never place credentials or secrets in this file.
